    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9529" root="حوط" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَيِّطٌ</span></b> , [originally either <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَوِيطٌ</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَيْوِطٌ</span>,] like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَيِّدٌ</span>,
A man <i>who guards, protects,</i> or <i>defends,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَحُوطُ</span>,)
<i>his family and his brethren.</i> (TA.)

